<title>UK: LONDON CURRENCY AND GOLD BULLION RATES.</title>
<headline>LONDON CURRENCY AND GOLD BULLION RATES.</headline>
<text>
<p>LONDON, Reuter - Following are the buying and selling rates for leading world currencies and gold against the dollar on the London foreign exchange and bullion markets today.</p>
<p>(Tourist rates will differ from those quoted)</p>
<p>US$1.00 COSTS    1.3453/58  Canadian Dollars</p>
<p>		     1.6310/20  German Marks</p>
<p>		     1.8319/24  Dutch Guilders</p>
<p>		     1.4130/40  Swiss Francs</p>
<p>		     33.62/63   Belgian Francs</p>
<p>		     5.5032/42  French Francs</p>
<p>		     1595.3/6.3 Italian Lire</p>
<p>		     119.15/25  Japanese Yen</p>
<p>		     7.2310/81  Swedish Crowns</p>
<p>		     6.5664/33  Norwegian Crowns</p>
<p>		     6.2247/57  Danish Crowns</p>
<p>		     1.4077/87  Singapore Dollars</p>
<p>		     0.7732/37  Australian Dollars</p>
<p>		     7.7408/18  Hong Kong Dollars</p>
<p>One Sterling     US$1.6320/30</p>
<p>Gold (ounce)     US$352.60/353.10</p>
